@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Start a mission  (copy the returned "id" into @sessionId)
POST {{host}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerName": "Khaled" }

###
@sessionId = PASTE-SESSION-ID-HERE

### 2) Current state (resources, crew, active emergency)
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### 3) Choose an option for the current emergency (use an option id from step 2)
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/choices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "optionId": 1 }

### 4) History of decisions
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/history

### 5) Play again
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/restart

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
